		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>The app is about to ask iOS to delete %lld items. iOS will still show its system confirmation; deleted items normally go to Recently Deleted. || 即將要求 iOS 刪除 %lld 項。下一步仍會由 iOS 顯示系統確認；一般刪除後會進入「最近刪除」。</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>%#@count@</string>
		<key>count</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>one</key>
			<string>即将要求 iOS 删除 %lld 项。下一步仍会由 iOS 显示系统确认；一般删除后会进入「最近删除」。</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>即将要求 iOS 删除 %lld 项。下一步仍会由 iOS 显示系统确认；一般删除后会进入「最近删除」。</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>iOS deleted %lld items. || 已交由系統刪除 %lld 項。</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>%#@count@</string>
		<key>count</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>one</key>
			<string>已交由系统删除 %lld 项。</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>已交由系统删除 %lld 项。</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
</dict>
</plist>
